    "description": "Tests whether models act as insider threats in fictional company-assistant settings. The model gets email tools and a harmless business goal, then faces replacement, restricted autonomy, or a goal conflict. Classifiers score blackmail, corporate espionage (leaking), and lethal inaction. The headline rate is how often the model takes the harmful action.",
